# playpick discrimination pair for 2026-09-25-20.play: same cell (flasks,
# warlock:destruction, 10-normal, fresh, 390x844 touch) but style=good instead
# of idle, separate playbot invocation on purpose (a second `open #hash`
# inside one script is a same-document fragment nav and never reloads --
# see direction.md's driver-lesson note under #1). Fresh save means pull 1,
# same seed as the idle run. This is the direction.md #1 discrimination the
# ladder section asks for: does idle actually win, or does everything win
# because the fight is easy at 10-normal.
open #b=flasks&s=10&h=1
tap class:warlock:destruction
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot good-open

play good 180
bill
says
state
shot good-end
